{"id":"campana","lemma":"campana","pos":"noun","rank":2733,"glosses":["bell","a bell-shaped (or roughly) object or component (such as the canopy of a parachute)","hood (device to suck away smokes and fumes)"],"ipa":"/kamˈpana/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"campanas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-campana.wav","examples":[{"text":"Oí la campana.","en":"I heard the bell.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442856","words":[{"g":"to hear","l":"oír"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Ahí está la campana.","en":"There's the bell.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443696","words":[{"g":"there"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Oímos las campanas de la iglesia.","en":"We heard the church bells.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/522052","words":[{"g":"to hear","l":"oír"},{"g":"the / them"},null,null,null,{"g":"church"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"of the"]]},{"text":"La campana suena a las ocho.","en":"The bell rings at eight.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to sound, to ring","l":"sonar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"eight"}]},{"text":"Nos salvó la campana.","en":"We were saved by the bell.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77007","words":[{"g":"us"},{"g":"to save","l":"salvar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}